The attached is the Oregon State Police CAD record for the March 24, 2026 v=
isit to my residence, released today under PR27478, together with my statem=
ent on it. OSP's own record documents the visit as low priority, no call ty=
pe, no action taken, and conducted
 &quot;for the Forest Service.&quot; Their legal compliance specialist cert=
ifies the record contained no exempt material =97 meaning there was no lawf=
ul basis for the months it was withheld.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
